@InvestmentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005
@consentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@userId = user-123
@investmentId = {{investment_id}}

### ─── Fixed Income (Renda Fixa) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all fixed income positions
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/fixed-incomes?userId={{userId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get fixed income investment details
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/fixed-incomes/{{investmentId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get fixed income balance (marked-to-market)
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/fixed-incomes/{{investmentId}}/balances
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get fixed income transactions (date range)
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/fixed-incomes/{{investmentId}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2026-12-31
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ─── Variable Income (Renda Variável) ──────────────────────────────────────

### List all variable income positions
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/variable-incomes?userId={{userId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get variable income details (with IR calculation)
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/variable-incomes/{{investmentId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get variable income balance
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/variable-incomes/{{investmentId}}/balances
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get variable income transactions
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/variable-incomes/{{investmentId}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2026-12-31
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ─── Treasury Bonds (Tesouro Direto) ───────────────────────────────────────

### List all Tesouro Direto positions
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/treasure-titles?userId={{userId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get treasury bond details (with regressive IR table)
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/treasure-titles/{{investmentId}}
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get treasury bond balance
GET {{InvestmentService_HostAddress}}/open-finance/v1/investments/treasure-titles/{{investmentId}}/balances
x-consent-id: {{consentId}}
Accept: application/json

###
